{"id":"da478762d021f626","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md","title":"Bernoulli Numbers","display":"df-bernoulli-numbers — Bernoulli Numbers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bernoulli-numbers","aliases":["58-df-bernoulli-numbers"],"display":"df-bernoulli-numbers — Bernoulli Numbers","depends_on":["[[58-df-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bernoulli-numbers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bernoulli-numbers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bernoulli-numbers — Bernoulli Numbers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"58-df-sequence\">58-df-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\omega\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(B:\\omega\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\)</span> (sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"58-df-sequence\">58-df-sequence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0!\\coloneqq1\">\\(0!\\coloneqq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\to(n+1)!\\coloneqq(n+1)n!\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\to(n+1)!\\coloneqq(n+1)n!\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\omega\">\\(m,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le m\">\\(k\\le m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\binom{m}{k}\\coloneqq m!/(k!(m-k)!)\">\\(\\binom{m}{k}\\coloneqq m!/(k!(m-k)!)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bernoulli\\text{-}numbers}\\vdash\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\land B(0)=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+1}{k}B(k)=0\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bernoulli\\text{-}numbers}\\vdash\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\land B(0)=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+1}{k}B(k)=0\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0 = 1, B_1 = -1/2, B_2 = 1/6, B_4 = -1/30, \\ldots\">\\(B_0 = 1, B_1 = -1/2, B_2 = 1/6, B_4 = -1/30, \\ldots\\)</span> (odd <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n &gt; 1\">\\(n &gt; 1\\)</span> give <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n = 0\">\\(B_n = 0\\)</span>).</li>\n<li>Faulhaber's formula (with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=-1/2\">\\(B_1=-1/2\\)</span>): <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{k=1}^N k^p=\\frac1{p+1}\\sum_{j=0}^{p}(-1)^j\\binom{p+1}{j}B_jN^{p+1-j}\">\\(\\sum_{k=1}^N k^p=\\frac1{p+1}\\sum_{j=0}^{p}(-1)^j\\binom{p+1}{j}B_jN^{p+1-j}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The von Staudt–Clausen theorem determines the fractional part of each even-indexed Bernoulli number.</li>\n<li>Connection to formal group laws and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic interpolation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)$ (sequence predicate, see [[58-df-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B:\\omega\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"0!\\coloneqq1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\to(n+1)!\\coloneqq(n+1)n!","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le m","display":false},{"tex":"\\binom{m}{k}\\coloneqq m!/(k!(m-k)!)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bernoulli\\text{-}numbers}\\vdash\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sequence}_S(B,\\mathbb Q)\\land B(0)=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{n+1}{k}B(k)=0\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"B_0 = 1, B_1 = -1/2, B_2 = 1/6, B_4 = -1/30, \\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"n > 1","display":false},{"tex":"B_n = 0","display":false},{"tex":"B_1=-1/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{k=1}^N k^p=\\frac1{p+1}\\sum_{j=0}^{p}(-1)^j\\binom{p+1}{j}B_jN^{p+1-j}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1233,"backlinks":[{"id":"9d0899f41785970a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\mathbb Q$ (from [[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]])."},{"id":"4d3551c550ac217a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md|58-df-bernoulli-numbers]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d8eb5064b65f8a92"]}